{"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI\/DismissSearchAction"},"relationshipsSections":[{"type":"conformsTo","kind":"relationships","identifiers":["doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/SQ"],"title":"Conforms To"}],"sections":[],"topicSections":[{"anchor":"Operators","identifiers":["doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI\/DismissSearchAction\/==(_:_:)"],"title":"Operators","generated":true},{"anchor":"Instance-Methods","identifiers":["doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI\/DismissSearchAction\/callAsFunction()"],"title":"Instance Methods","generated":true},{"anchor":"Default-Implementations","identifiers":["doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI\/DismissSearchAction\/Equatable-Implementations"],"title":"Default Implementations","generated":true}],"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"platforms":["macOS"],"languages":["swift"],"tokens":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"DismissSearchAction"}]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"content":[{"level":2,"type":"heading","anchor":"overview","text":"Overview"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Use the "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI\/EnvironmentValues\/dismissSearch","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" environment value to get the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"instance of this structure for a given "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI\/Environment","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":". Then call the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"instance to dismiss the current search interaction. You call the instance"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"directly because it defines a "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI\/DismissSearchAction\/callAsFunction()","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"method that Swift calls when you call the instance."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"When you dismiss search, OpenSwiftUI:"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Sets "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"EnvironmentValues\/isSearching"},{"type":"text","text":" to "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"false"},{"text":".","type":"text"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Clears any text from the search field.","type":"text"}]}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Removes focus from the search field."}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"type":"unorderedList"},{"style":"note","type":"aside","content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Calling this instance has no effect if the user isn’t"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"interacting with a search field."}],"type":"paragraph"}],"name":"Note"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Use this action to dismiss a search operation based on"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"another user interaction. For example, consider a searchable"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"view with a "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Button"},{"type":"text","text":" that presents more information about the first"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"matching item from a collection:"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"codeListing","syntax":null,"code":["struct ContentView: View {","    @State private var text = \"\"","","    var body: some View {","        NavigationView {","            SearchResults(searchText: text)","                .searchable(text: $text)","        }","    }","}","","private struct SearchResults: View {","    let searchText: String","","    let items = [\"a\", \"b\", \"c\"]","    var filteredItems: [String] { items.filter { $0 == searchText.lowercased() } }","","    @State private var isPresented = false","","    var body: some View {","        if let item = filteredItems.first {","            Button(\"Details about \\(item)\") {","                isPresented = true","            }","            .sheet(isPresented: $isPresented) {","                NavigationView {","                    DetailView(item: item)","                }","            }","        }","    }","}"]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The button becomes visible only after the user enters search text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"that produces a match. When the user taps the button, OpenSwiftUI shows"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"a sheet that provides more information about the item, including"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"an Add button for adding the item to a stored list of items:"}]},{"type":"codeListing","code":["private struct DetailView: View {","    let item: String","","    @Environment(\\.dismiss) private var dismiss","    @Environment(\\.dismissSearch) private var dismissSearch","","    var body: some View {","        Text(\"Information about \\(item).\")","            .toolbar {","                Button(\"Add\") {","                    \/\/ Store the item here...","","                    dismiss()","                    dismissSearch()","                }","            }","    }","}"],"syntax":null},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The user can dismiss the sheet by dragging it down, effectively"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"canceling the operation, leaving the in-progress search interaction"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"intact. Alternatively, the user can tap the Add button to store the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"item. Because the user is likely to be done with both the detail view"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"and the search interaction at this point, the button’s closure also"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"uses the "},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI\/EnvironmentValues\/dismiss","type":"reference"},{"text":" property to dismiss the sheet,","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"and the ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI\/EnvironmentValues\/dismissSearch","type":"reference"},{"type":"text","text":" property to reset the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"search field."}]}],"kind":"content"}],"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/openswiftui\/dismisssearchaction"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI"]]},"schemaVersion":{"patch":0,"minor":3,"major":0},"metadata":{"fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"DismissSearchAction"}],"modules":[{"name":"OpenSwiftUI"}],"title":"DismissSearchAction","role":"symbol","roleHeading":"Structure","symbolKind":"struct","navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"DismissSearchAction"}],"externalID":"s:11OpenSwiftUI19DismissSearchActionV"},"kind":"symbol","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"An action that can end a search interaction."}],"references":{"doc://OpenSwiftUI/documentation/OpenSwiftUI/DismissSearchAction/callAsFunction()":{"fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"callAsFunction","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"()","kind":"text"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI\/DismissSearchAction\/callAsFunction()","role":"symbol","abstract":[{"text":"Dismisses the current search operation, if any.","type":"text"}],"title":"callAsFunction()","url":"\/documentation\/openswiftui\/dismisssearchaction\/callasfunction()","kind":"symbol","type":"topic"},"doc://OpenSwiftUI/documentation/OpenSwiftUI/EnvironmentValues/dismissSearch":{"url":"\/documentation\/openswiftui\/